{
  "about": "FROZEN catalog manifest (CS-402, UI_RULES 130). Every PUBLISHED build-decision question (id -> type + option ids) and every published draft id. test-review-additive.mjs fails if the catalog drops a manifest id, changes a type or option ids, loses an option, or adds an id NOT listed here. Publishing a new question or draft means appending it here in the SAME change (like buildDecisionIds.js). Never edit an entry to match a renumbered id or option. Answers in state.clientReview are keyed by these ids. RETIRING a published draft (2026-10-20): its id STAYS in `drafts` and gets an entry in `retiredDrafts` ({ retired, reason }); it leaves the catalog, Matt's answer keyed by it stays in state.clientReview untouched, and a retired id is never reused.",
